{"server":"cn","storyId":"1stact_level_a001_ex06_end","groupId":"1stact","stageId":"a001_ex06","title":"西部往事","storyCode":"GT-HX-3","avgTag":"行动后","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/a001/level_a001_ex06_end.txt","sourceHash":"7741b8e0b01779af17b1e4546bb8c53da3e50c0cf08a938e2035182e96da096c","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"第六关（后）"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_infirmary"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"站住，凯尔希。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"你回来了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"现在你是想通了，还是怎么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"你想要这个对吧，拿去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"你私自出动了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"我不干涉干员的私事，也不会过问他们做了些什么，只要他们没有损害罗德岛的利益。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"希望你的行为不要有失你在罗德岛的身份，斯卡蒂。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"冷嘲热讽就免了。规矩我很清楚，一物换一物。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"你想要从我这里换到什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"信息。"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"ac1_ex6"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"我所拥有的信息的价值，真有这么轻贱？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"我可以立刻就把这块石头捏成碎片，你不想这样。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"但我知道你假称任务，去了卡西米尔的滴水村，还和其他干员发生了冲突。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"那个孩子无论是在滴水村还是在罗德岛，都替你保守了秘密。但我绝没有向你发布过任何类似的任务。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？血已经注满了融芯。这不是你的血，你不敢在大地上流血。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"是格拉尼的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"你已经做了这种事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"我会回报她，这不用你提醒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道你需要这东西，钥匙、核心、记忆块，随便它是什么。我必须弄到手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"“颅腔”，“火肺”，“黄烟”，我全都解决了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"否则，这东西早已落到他们手上了。而和他们交易的绝不会是你，因为你给不出他们要的东西，你不会做那种事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"你需要这块“石头”，我需要知道我想知道的东西。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"你和你的种群让我感到可笑，我并不依赖任何一个零件去拼凑出大地的全貌。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"你与罗德岛由契约相连，你与我也当如是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"一物换一物。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"难得看见你恼怒的样子。只有在这种时候，你才会一改平常的慵懒和颓废。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"你想知道幽灵鲨身上源石神经剂的来源。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"——你是怎么知道的？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"（阿戈尔语）“深海猎人血脉相连”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"我无所不知。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"......告诉我。"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_infirmary"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"可以。只要你听我的命令，我甚至会主动帮助你。前提是，你必须听从命令。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"我只相信可信之人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"我言而有信。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_003_kalts","aliases":["凯尔希"]},{"speakerId":"char_263_skadi","aliases":["斯卡蒂"]}]}
